{title: Pukarta Chala Hu Main}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi O P Nayyar}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Cm] Pukaarataa Chalaa Huun Main,        Galii [D#] Galii Bahaar [Cm] Kii
Bas Ek Chhaanv Zulf [A#] Kii,        Bas Ik [Cm] Nigaah Pyaar [D#] Kii
Pukaara [Cm] taa Chalaa Huun Main...        [Cm] Ye Dillagii Ye Shokhiyaan Salaam Kii
Yahin To Baat Ho Rahii Hai Kaam [A#] Kii,        Koi To Mud Ke Dekh Legaa Is Taraf
Koi [G] Nazar To Hogii Mere Naam [Cm] Kii,        Pukaarataa Chalaa Huun Main...
[Cm] Sunii Merii Sadaa To Kis Yaqiin Se,        Ghataa Utar Ke Aa Gayii Zamiin [A#] Pe
Rahii Yahii Lagan To Ai Dil-E-Javaan,        Asar Bhii [G] Ho Rahegaa Ik Hasiin [Cm] Pe
Pukaarataa Chalaa Huun Main
